  and verify the actual hosted result rather than assuming a push deployed it.

Tasks:
  [x] Review the complete source/privacy boundary, remote branch and workflow.
  [x] Refresh README content while preserving approved illustrated artwork.
  [x] Reconcile living guides with the now-authorized publication scope.
  [x] Create and verify this original issue/Project identity and backlink.
  [ ] Stage only reviewed public files and verify effective commit attribution.
  [ ] Commit/push the qualified candidate using reviewed scoped authentication.
